 worf  is the one who's forced to assist with  keiko's pregnancy so this is why five  years later in a session when quark  delivers the news wharf's immediate  reaction is to respond with a panicked  now  check out one of our newest videos right  here plus even more looper videos about  star trek are coming soon subscribe to  our youtube channel and hit the bell so  you don't miss a single one  [Music]

